        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Higa ni maneno ga Jeremia mwana wa Hilikiya, mlavyadzi-sadaka kula mudzi wa Anathothi kahi ya tsi ya mbari ya Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2 Afalume 22:3—23:27; 2 Nyakati 34:8—35:19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba na Jeremia mwaka wa kumi na tahu wa utawala wa mfalume Josiya mwana wa Amoni, yekala mfalume wa Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2 Afalume 23:36—24:7; 24:18—25:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.11+2CH.36.12+2CH.36.13+2CH.36.14+2CH.36.15+2CH.36.16+2CH.36.17+2CH.36.18+2CH.36.19+2CH.36.20+2CH.36.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Nyakati 36:11–21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wagomba naye tsona kula wakati wa utawala wa mfalume Jehoyakimu mwana wa Josiya, yekala mfalume wa Juda, hadi mwezi wa tsano wa mwaka wa kumi na mwenga wa utawala wa Zedekiya, mfalume wa Juda, Jerusalemu iriphohalwa mateka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu waniamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kabila ya kukuumba ndanini mwa mayoo mimi nákumanya, na kabila kudzangbwevyalwa nákutenga, Nákutsambula ukale nabii wa mataifa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho nchiamba, “Aa, Mwenyezi Mlungu! Lola, mimi siweza kugomba vinono mana nchere mwanache.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Mwenyezi Mlungu achiniamba, “Usiambe, ‘Nchere mwanache,’ mana ni uphiye kpwa osi ndiokuhuma kpwao, na uaambire gosi ndigokulagiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usiaogophe mana ni phamwenga nawe ili nikuokole. Mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu nkaamba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Mwenyezi Mlungu achigolosa mkpwono achiniguta mromo chisha achiamba,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Mwenyezi Mlungu achigomba nami achiamba, “Jeremia, unaonani?” Nami nchijibu nchiamba, “Naona chipanda cha Mlozi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha ye Mwenyezi Mlungu achiniamba, “Uwe ukaona vinono, mana kpwa kpweli nkakusudiya kutimiza neno rangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu achiniuza tsona, “Unaonani?” Nchimjibu nchiamba, “Naona nyungu inaokoha nayo ikaweka na inamwaga kula uphande wa vurini.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Mwenyezi Mlungu achiniamba, “Osi akalao kahi za tsi andaphahwa ni mashaka kula vurini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana lola ninaiha atu osi a tawala za vurini, Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, atawala aho andakpwedza avamie maryango ga Jerusalemu; abomole kutaze zosi na aangamize midzi yosi ya Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindatangaza uamuli wangu dzulu ya atu angu kpwa sababu ya uyi wao wa kuniricha na kulavira sadaka za kuochwa milungu yanjina na kuabudu vizuka ambavyo avitengeza na mikono yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Funga nguwo zidine Jeremia! Unuka uaambire mambo gosi nikulagizago. Usiaogophe, sedze nikakuhenda ukakame kpwa wuoga mbere zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rero nkakuhenda ukale mudzi wenye ngome, mnara wa chuma na ukuta wa shaba. Undaweza kuima chinyume cha tsi ndzima, afalume a Juda, maofisaage, alavyadzi-sadaka na atu osi a tsi hiyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andapigana nawe ela taandakuturya tse, mana ni phamwenga nawe ili nikuokole. Mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu nkaamba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.1.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
